Ever wondered how much XP that orb was worth, or how much Mending just fixed?
[B]GainExpDisplay[/B] shows it in the action bar, right above your hotbar.[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]✨ Features[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]XP gained[/B] in the action bar, like [FONT=Courier New]Gain XP: +7[/FONT]
[*][B]Mending repairs[/B] with the item's durability, like [FONT=Courier New]Mending Repair: +10 (1071/1561)[/FONT]
[*][B]Your own messages[/B] with colours, gradients and formatting ([URL='https://docs.papermc.io/adventure/minimessage/format/']MiniMessage[/URL])
[*][B]7 languages:[/B] English, Spanish, German, French, Chinese, Japanese and Thai, or add your own
[*][B]Permissions[/B] to choose who sees each message
[*][B]Spigot, Paper, Purpur and Folia[/B], Minecraft [B]1.17 – 26.3[/B], one jar for all of them
[*][B]Lightweight:[/B] only reacts to XP and Mending, nothing runs in the background
[/LIST]

